 <summary>How the website is built</summary>
 <p>The site is built to work across phones and computers, with clear paths for calls, enquiries and ordinary links to services you already use.</p>
 <p>Servo ICT uses Astro for focused business websites. It sends the page content as lightweight HTML and adds interactive code where it is useful. Astro is open source, and the agreed source and deployment notes are included so another developer can maintain the site.</p>
